Retain an existing Snap camera hotseat item when upgrading the C5 to
the system Camera2 app. Resolve the replacement for the shortcut's own
profile, retaining its ID and position. Leave customized layouts alone.

Related report (Snap icon disappearance with a different cause):
https://gitlab.com/LineageOS/issues/android/-/issues/4295

